/*
  VehicleCommandCenter.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0261 · VehicleCommandCenter (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `VehicleCommandCenter` (+ its catalog, dialogs, tiles and banners) resolves
  (table "VehicleCommandCenter") lives here with its web English value. These
  entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration
  time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns
  its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  Keys mirror the web source verbatim where the web component / commands.ts use a
  `t(key, default)` (the `commands.*` command labels, category labels, dialog
  prompts, select options and confirm copy). The remaining keys back the native
  chrome (freshness chip, relative-time labels, banners, search field, tile
  accessibility, dialogs).
*/


